# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @your-org/release-reviewers with
# the people or team who approve releases. With "Require review from Code
# Owners" turned on, a pull request that changes any of these paths cannot
# merge without their approval. See docs/ci.md in the skill.

# The workflow that runs the gate, and this file.
/.github/workflows/ @your-org/release-reviewers
/.github/CODEOWNERS @your-org/release-reviewers

# The release gate and the rest of the skill.
/.agents/skills/application-guardian/ @your-org/release-reviewers

# The audit result. Accepted risks and their approvers live here.
/docs/audits/audit-result.json @your-org/release-reviewers

# Optional: the tests that prove the mandatory checks. Add the folders your
# audit commands run, so a weakened test also needs release approval.
# /tests/security/ @your-org/release-reviewers
